Template: dahlia/title
Type: title
Description: Dahlia Linux

Template: dahlia/disk
Type: select
Choices-C: ${CHOICES_C}
Choices: ${CHOICES}
Description: System disk for Dahlia Linux:
 Dahlia Linux is installed on this disk. Everything on it will be deleted.
 .
 Pick an SSD. Data disks for the array are not touched by the installer;
 add them later in the dashboard.

Template: dahlia/hostname
Type: string
Default: dahlia
Description: Server name:
 One word: lower case letters, digits and hyphens. The server is reachable
 as <name>.local in the local network.

Template: dahlia/timezone
Type: select
Choices: Europe/Berlin, Europe/Vienna, Europe/Zurich, Europe/Amsterdam, Europe/Brussels, Europe/Paris, Europe/London, Europe/Madrid, Europe/Rome, Europe/Stockholm, Europe/Warsaw, America/New_York, America/Chicago, America/Denver, America/Los_Angeles, Asia/Tokyo, Australia/Sydney, UTC
Default: Europe/Berlin
Description: Time zone:

Template: dahlia/network
Type: select
Choices-C: dhcp, static
Choices: Automatic (DHCP), Static address
Default: dhcp
Description: Network configuration of the installed system:
 The installer itself uses DHCP. With a static address, the installed
 system uses the address entered next from the first boot on.

Template: dahlia/address
Type: string
Description: IPv4 address with prefix length:
 Example: 192.168.1.10/24

Template: dahlia/gateway
Type: string
Description: Gateway:
 Example: 192.168.1.1

Template: dahlia/dns
Type: string
Description: DNS server:
 Example: 192.168.1.1

Template: dahlia/account
Type: string
Description: Account name:
 ${MESSAGE}
 .
 Lower case letters, digits, "-" and "_", starting with a letter, 2 to 32
 characters. The same name logs in to the console, via SSH, to the dashboard
 and to its terminal.

Template: dahlia/ssh_key
Type: string
Description: SSH public key for ${ACCOUNT} (optional):
 Paste one line from ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub or similar to log in without a
 password. Leave empty to skip; keys can be added later.

Template: dahlia/invalid
Type: error
Description: Invalid input
 ${MESSAGE}

Template: dahlia/no_disk
Type: error
Description: No disk found
 The installer found no disk to install Dahlia Linux on. The install
 medium itself is never offered.

Template: dahlia/confirm
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Delete ${DISK} and install Dahlia Linux?
 Summary:
 .
   Disk:         ${DISK_LABEL}
   Server name:  ${HOSTNAME}
   Time zone:    ${TIMEZONE}
   Network:      ${NETWORK}
   Account:      ${ACCOUNT}
   SSH key:      ${SSH_KEY}
 .
 ALL DATA ON ${DISK} WILL BE DELETED. Choose "No" to change the answers.
